    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Text
      value: You enter through the gate, as it turns out this is a village entirely
        for rats.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[1].Text
      value: The village seems sparsely populated, the rats look hungry and wary
        of strangers.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[2].Text
      value: You get the impression that these people are usually quite friendly,
        but are currently struggling through hard times.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[3].Text
      value: "There\u2019s a large, manor-like house further into the village that
        seems like it might be the Mayor's house."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[4].Text
      value: Well, this place is kind of miserable.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[5].Text
      value: "I think it has a lovely ambience, meow! There\u2019s lots of trees!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
